From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:20:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: watchdog: mediatek,mtk-wdt: Add MT6789

The MT6789 TOPRGU is register compatible with the MT6589 watchdog and
also resets the CONNSYS MCU through WDT_SWSYSRST. Add its compatible,
with the MT6589 fallback, and the reset index for the CONN MCU.

Only bit 12 (CONN MCU) is taken from MediaTek's MT6789 CONNSYS code;
the other WDT_SWSYSRST bits are not described until they are known.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml        | 1 +
 include/dt-bindings/reset/mediatek,mt6789-resets.h            | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
index 953629cb..a6b10b7c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
               - mediatek,mt2701-wdt
               - mediatek,mt6572-wdt
               - mediatek,mt6582-wdt
+              - mediatek,mt6789-wdt
               - mediatek,mt6797-wdt
               - mediatek,mt7622-wdt
               - mediatek,mt7623-wdt
diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/reset/mediatek,mt6789-resets.h b/include/dt-bindings/reset/mediatek,mt6789-resets.h
index 1918ebef..4c19a399 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/reset/mediatek,mt6789-resets.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/reset/mediatek,mt6789-resets.h
@@ -9,4 +9,8 @@
 #define MT6789_INFRA_RST2_UNIPRO_SWRST		2
 #define MT6789_INFRA_RST3_UFS_CRYPTO_SWRST	3
 
+/* TOPRGU resets */
+#define MT6789_TOPRGU_CONN_MCU_SW_RST		12
+#define MT6789_TOPRGU_SW_RST_NUM		13
+
 #endif  /* _DT_BINDINGS_RESET_CONTROLLER_MT6789 */
